  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.7: \n - Fixed value for Activity Parties.\n\nv1.0.6: \n - Added check if the user doesn't have access to any Document Template in the selected environment.\n\nv1.0.5: \n - Fix PackageIconUrl path.\n\nv1.0.4: \n - Updated to PackageIconUrl from PackageIcon because XrmToolBox doesn't support it.\n\nv1.0.3: \n - Updated package metadata and license information.\n\nv1.0.2: \n - Fixed some issues with column definitions not containing a Logical Name.\n - Added Page Size setting to control the number of records retrieved per request.\n\nv1.0.1: \n - Fixed a situation where the export would keep running even after the tool was closed, but XrmToolBox was still open.\n\nv1.0.0: \n - First release of ShkoOnline.DataverseExcelReporter tool.\n - Multilingual support added (English & Italian).\n - Improved performance for large datasets.",
